"Heliodor is checked in layers, from unit tests that take seconds to Linux "
"boots and compliance suites that take hours. This chapter lists the layers, "
"how to run each one, and what a pass means. The cycle counts and timings "
"quoted here are for the 2-wide configuration unless a column says otherwise; "
"[Performance](performance.md) has the full set."
msgstr ""
"Heliodor は、数秒で終わる単体テストから、数時間かかる Linux の起動や準拠ス"
"イートまで、層に分けて検証します。この章では、各層と、その実行方法、合格が何"
"を意味するかを説明します。ここに示すサイクル数と時間は、列に別の記載がない限"
"り 2-wide 構成のものです。全体は[性能](performance.md)にあります。"

